<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style=""><font face="arial">Hello <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">Client,</span></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br>Thank you for letting me know about <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">[employee name</span>]'s situation. I understand it can be frustrating to miss the open enrollment window. Unfortunately, under the rules outlined in the Summary Plan Description (SPD) for the Insperity Group Health Plan, changes to benefit elections are only allowed during initial or annual open enrollment periods-unless the employee experiences a <b>Qualifying Life Event (QLE).</b></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br>Examples of QLEs include:</font></div><div style=""><ul><li><font face="arial">Marriage, divorce, or legal separation</font></li><li><font face="arial">Beginning or ending a domestic partnership</font></li><li><font face="arial">Birth, adoption, or placement for adoption</font></li><li><font face="arial">Death of a dependent</font></li><li><font face="arial">Loss or gain of eligibility under another group health plan</font></li><li><font face="arial">Court order requiring coverage (QMCSO)</font></li><li><font face="arial">Change in residence affecting eligibility</font></li><li><font face="arial">Gaining or losing eligibility for Medicare, Medicaid, or CHIP</font></li><li><font face="arial">Enrollment in Marketplace coverage</font></li><li><font face="arial">Reduction in hours (less than 30 per week) with enrollment in other coverage</font></li><li><font face="arial">Other events permitted by the Plan</font></li></ul></div><div style=""><font face="arial">If <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">[employee name]</span> experiences one of these events, they can submit a mid-year change online by selecting <b>Mid-Year Change &gt; Access Now</b> in the Benefits section of the Insperity Premier Portal. The SPD is also available on the portal for more details.</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br>Please let me know if I can help with any questions or guide [<span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">employee name]</span> through the process should a qualifying event occur.</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">[signature]</span></font></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>